* Your faction standing with [[Merchants of AkAnon]] has been adjusted by 5.
* Your faction standing with [[King AkAnon]] has been adjusted by 5.
* Your faction standing with [[Dark Reflection]] has been adjusted by -2.
* Your faction standing with [[Clan Grikbar]] has been adjusted by -1.
</div>
{{Exp}}

You say, 'regurgitonic'.
 
:Kimble Nogflop says 'I formulate the Regurgitonic myself. My animals kept eating the occasional spectator here and there. Femurs and ribs kept getting stuck inside, not to mention a few platinum pieces. Sometimes my batch would come out wrong and the animals would go berserk!! '''I hope I got the formula right this time'''.'

If you choose to give the [[Regurgitonic]] to [[Mammoth]]:

: Mammoth coughs up something. 
